  "description": "An attractive arts high school couple broke up and became actors, but ex-boyfriend Sun-ho is a famous top star, while Na-eun is an unknown actress... Is this right? Instead of being more successful than her ex, she faces a reality check and is about to retire from the entertainment industry when she receives an A-list script. But the male lead of this romantic comedy is her ex-boyfriend? How is she supposed to shoot a kiss scene with that guy!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=853820), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14587371)",
